<title>USA: Forrest City Financial Corp Q1 Sept 30 loss.</title>
<headline>Forrest City Financial Corp Q1 Sept 30 loss.</headline>
<dateline>FORREST CITY, Ark 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.41		    $0.21</p>
<p> Net loss	  82,881		    47,124</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the loss was due to the one-time SAIF assesment of approximately 168,000 and an increase in bad debt reserves of $44,418.</p>
<p>Full company name is Forrest City Financial Corp and the stock trades on the Nasdaq pink sheets under the symbol &quot;FOCF.&quot;</p>
